    marksCorrect: 4,
    marksWrong: -1,
    questionText: `A rectangular park has its sides parallel to the coordinate axes. Three of its corners are $A(-6,9)$, $B(10,9)$, $D(-6,-11)$. Find the coordinates of the fourth corner $C$.`,
